f-a8f8-6b4f0c6ede3a" style="--span-d:12;--span-t:12;--span-m:12"><h2 data-widget-id="7e3c17ab-e006-468a-9fee-568352f5b131" data-widget-type="heading">Todo lo que necesitas, nada de más</h2><div data-widget-id="467f883e-c47a-4c78-a787-2ba275ba9c89" data-widget-type="list" class="v2-list v2-list-bento"><article><span class="v2-index">01</span><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/tallo-ventas/1200/900" alt="" loading="lazy"><h3>Ventas y cobros</h3><p>Cotiza, factura y recibe pagos en línea.</p></article><article><span class="v2-index">02</span><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/tallo-inventario/1200/900" alt="" loading="lazy"><h3>Inventario vivo</h3><p>Stock que se actualiza con cada venta.</p></article><article><span class="v2-index">03</span><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/tallo-panel/1200/900" alt="" loading="lazy"><h3>Panel en tiempo real</h3><p>Tus números clave, siempre a la vista.</p></article><article><span class="v2-index">04</span><h3>Multiusuario</h3><p>Roles y permisos para todo tu equipo.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section id="benefits" class="v2-section v2-region-main v2-key-benefits" data-section-id="710bac3d-122a-47cd-9cc1-0c9ea452eb50"><div class="v2-section-inner"><div class="v2-row" data-row-id="069c6f56-b9f4-4825-b44f-59fd9cac2dc5"><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="548d05ae-43d1-4d6c-a18e-36d653daed10" style="--span-d:5;--span-t:5;--span-m:12"><h2 data-widget-id="68c42a1c-4483-4e31-a67e-7e1c5fa632d3" data-widget-type="heading">Resultados reales</h2><p data-widget-id="d39c230c-d834-417e-8100-65aadde1115a" data-widget-type="text">Equipos que usan Tallo cierran su mes en horas, no días.</p></div><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="0f1573c6-c61a-4f1e-b5b1-333600d7380c" style="--span-d:7;--span-t:12;--span-m:12"><div data-widget-id="8f1cf2f5-4ad7-4f22-9552-619df6160e75" data-widget-type="list" class="v2-list v2-list-metrics"><article><span class="v2-index">01</span><h3>-9h</h3><p>de trabajo manual al mes</p></article><article><span class="v2-index">02</span><h3>2 min</h3><p>para emitir una factura</p></article><article><span class="v2-index">03</span><h3>99.9%</h3><p>de tiempo activo</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section id="how" class="v2-section v2-region-main v2-key-how" data-section-id="1ce42c43-71f9-4ee2-b28d-7448a3bfe502"><div class="v2-section-inner"><div class="v2-row" data-row-id="13eac40e-1e40-4138-9890-b6d85e774ea9"><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="2dbf2c5e-8fa9-4407-921a-60d39ad8fe69" style="--span-d:12;--span-t:12;--span-m:12"><div data-widget-id="eb2fb623-060d-4810-b15a-df9b51b251e4" data-widget-type="list" class="v2-list v2-list-numbered"><article><span class="v2-index">01</span><h3>Facturación en un clic</h3><p>Emite y cobra sin salir del panel.</p></article><article><span class="v2-index">02</span><h3>Conecta tu banco</h3><p>Concilia pagos automáticamente.</p></article><article><span class="v2-index">03</span><h3>Reportes al instante</h3><p>Sabe qué se vende y qué sobra.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section id="reviews" class="v2-section v2-region-main v2-key-reviews" data-section-id="9ea4ac71-fd56-4b2c-87a2-c1d06cf907d2"><div class="v2-section-inner"><div class="v2-row" data-row-id="d9ae7d93-4aee-4f7f-8c86-24c16d55ea3e"><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="a817793a-e045-4b44-a653-4638be8940d3" style="--span-d:12;--span-t:12;--span-m:12"><div data-widget-id="83978c56-7f01-4cef-9d6d-440ce8c262d5" data-widget-type="testimonials" class="v2-testimonials v2-testimonials-featured"><figure><div class="v2-stars" aria-label="5 de 5 estrellas">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Pasé de tres hojas de cálculo a una sola pantalla. No vuelvo atrás.”</blockquote><figcaption><strong>Lucía Fernández</strong><span>Dueña, Panadería Sur</span></figcaption></figure><figure><div class="v2-stars" aria-label="5 de 5 estrellas">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Concilio el banco en cinco minutos. Antes me tomaba media mañana.”</blockquote><figcaption><strong>Marc 