 class="v2-row" data-row-id="a79ec032-d182-4b9c-822c-8e8352b14c1e"><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="8d7f0bc2-6693-43d6-86ca-fe0d7041cab8" style="--span-d:3;--span-t:3;--span-m:12"><a data-widget-id="8f06f155-6290-47f3-9b75-c3dbc343c464" data-widget-type="brand" class="v2-brand" href="#top"><strong>Vento Estudio</strong></a></div><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="e892b9ea-6dde-422b-9c03-c1feae308330" style="--span-d:9;--span-t:12;--span-m:12"><nav data-widget-id="8ea2138f-aa8e-4075-bf87-6ac11d1daae3" data-widget-type="nav" aria-label="Navegación principal"><a href="#services">Servicios</a><a href="#about">Nosotros</a><a href="#contact">Contacto</a></nav></div></div></div></section><section id="hero" class="v2-section v2-region-main v2-key-hero" data-section-id="be225cac-83ed-4797-8b2d-8250cacdc403"><div class="v2-section-inner"><div class="v2-row" data-row-id="1ffb335b-4d61-4c12-b6ea-137f1be10234"><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="b978ce35-c99d-4869-abd0-d2b919b49eac" style="--span-d:6;--span-t:6;--span-m:12"><h1 data-widget-id="9a23e1ee-2936-4153-bf20-a2e687847c1d" data-widget-type="heading">Diseño que la gente recuerda</h1><p data-widget-id="390a83a8-5106-40e4-873e-45192ecab228" data-widget-type="text">Marca, web y dirección de arte</p><a data-widget-id="2f0049fe-352d-4578-ac61-46d5dbe8b94f" data-widget-type="button" class="v2-button v2-button-solid" href="#contact">Ver disponibilidad</a></div><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="3b55aaba-8f62-459e-b8c2-f4ee13313da8" style="--span-d:6;--span-t:6;--span-m:12"><img data-widget-id="e888a28d-e324-4289-948e-898e4a67b0cd" data-widget-type="image" class="v2-image v2-image-wide" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/vento-hero-studio/1400/1000" alt="Vento Estudio" loading="lazy"></div></div></div></section><section id="work" class="v2-section v2-region-main v2-key-work" data-section-id="7cc9761e-c63a-49a8-a231-4a1afe9777bd"><div class="v2-section-inner"><div class="v2-row" data-row-id="68a16264-8066-4393-94f3-576857e75d75"><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="52ced79e-9903-49ef-b77f-ef58661be606" style="--span-d:12;--span-t:12;--span-m:12"><div data-widget-id="2f8887d6-b2a8-4d42-999b-78f5e404425c" data-widget-type="gallery" class="v2-gallery v2-gallery-mosaic"><figure><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/vento-work-1/1000/1000" alt="Proyecto de marca" loading="lazy"></figure><figure><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/vento-work-2/1000/1000" alt="Sistema visual" loading="lazy"></figure><figure><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/vento-work-3/1000/1000" alt="Campaña" loading="lazy"></figure><figure><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/vento-work-4/1000/1000" alt="Editorial" loading="lazy"></figure><figure><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/vento-work-5/1000/1000" alt="Empaque" loading="lazy"></figure></div></div></div></div></section><section id="projects" class="v2-section v2-region-main v2-key-projects" data-section-id="3fcb263f-c0d5-490d-8dea-b7b6c921df51"><div class="v2-section-inner"><div class="v2-row" data-row-id="4c6d271c-848b-40dd-8f99-ad7b8a6d6114"><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="860869ad-ca63-413d-b39e-b2dad57876e2" style="--span-d:12;--span-t:12;--span-m:12"><h2 data-widget-id="b15c109a-0ad6-42dc-b043-565ca08ad85c" data-widget-type="heading">Un estudio, no una fábrica</h2><div data-widget-id="4e41f8f7-5775-4658-b266-bc34cfe4024a" data-widget-type="list" class="v2-list v2-list-bento"><article><span class="v2-index">01</span><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/vento-identidad/1200/900" alt="" loading="lazy"><h3>Identidad de marca</h3><p>Naming, logotipo, sistema visual y guía de uso.</p><small>Desde 6 semanas</small></article><article><span class="v2-index">02</span><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/vento-web/1200/900" alt="" loading="lazy"><h3>Diseño web</h3><p>Sitios a medida, rápidos y fáciles de administrar.</p><small>Diseño y desarrollo</small></article><article><span class="v2-index">03</span><img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/vento-arte/1200/900" alt="" loading="lazy"><h3>Dirección de arte</h3><p>Campañas, fotografía y contenido con una voz clara.</p><small>Por proyecto</small></article></div></div></div></div></section><section id="studio" class="v2-section v2-region-main v2-key-studio" data-section-id="a3595a71-b582-47ef-ba64-75d7d188a551"><div class="v2-section-inner"><div class="v2-row" data-row-id="77850814-aa57-44ed-aeaa-1fe0590c8e25"><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="efc3ac24-91b3-4e73-be3c-a391445d075e" style="--span-d:5;--span-t:5;--span-m:12"><h2 data-widget-id="c507d097-22e6-4a23-b8ed-510c0d0ee744" data-widget-type="heading">Cómo trabajamos</h2><p data-widget-id="50c4abcd-34f1-497a-b86d-3595198434f1" data-widget-type="text">Cada proyecto lo lidera quien lo diseña. Sin capas intermedias, sin plantillas: investigamos, proponemos y ejecutamos con criterio hasta que la marca se sostiene sola.</p></div><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="cb8d2541-127a-4a23-a1bb-9e3839b9d4e3" style="--span-d:7;--span-t:12;--span-m:12"><div data-widget-id="f541c76d-d4b0-4bdd-8e8c-40de9b78ac87" data-widget-type="list" class="v2-list v2-list-metrics"><article><span class="v2-index">01</span><h3>48</h3><p>marcas lanzadas</p></article><article><span class="v2-index">02</span><h3>9</h3><p>años de estudio</p></article><article><span class="v2-index">03</span><h3>3 sem</h3><p>para una identidad base</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section id="reviews" class="v2-section v2-region-main v2-key-reviews" data-section-id="418f7d4d-276d-46c1-b6d2-82c7018e6d22"><div class="v2-section-inner"><div class="v2-row" data-row-id="054071de-5439-43d7-8944-06a00007d42e"><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="bff4e9b3-f9f2-4cf8-9d4b-36c57aed272f" style="--span-d:12;--span-t:12;--span-m:12"><div data-widget-id="7a1a28a0-d0d6-4885-a04b-c1aea310fc6f" data-widget-type="testimonials" class="v2-testimonials v2-testimonials-wall"><figure><div class="v2-stars" aria-label="5 de 5 estrellas">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Entendieron la marca mejor que nosotros y la tradujeron en algo que por fin se siente nuestro.”</blockquote><figcaption><strong>Renata Salcedo</strong><span>Fundadora, Miel</span></figcaption></figure><figure><div class="v2-stars" aria-label="5 de 5 estrellas">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“El sitio nuevo triplicó las solicitudes de demo en dos meses.”</blockquote><figcaption><strong>Tomás Iriarte</strong><span>CEO, Nodo</span></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div></section><section id="contact" class="v2-section v2-region-main v2-key-contact" data-section-id="06413f7e-6196-48cd-87fe-4db858959f18"><div class="v2-section-inner"><div class="v2-row" data-row-id="76fcae9f-6616-45d6-a0ec-a049f9279986"><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="8c6319c1-1ca0-4bca-9f5b-2de591ab231f" style="--span-d:6;--span-t:6;--span-m:12"><h2 data-widget-id="69c16f7a-8f5e-4443-9d73-6e1cc3679aa5" data-widget-type="heading">Cuéntanos del proyecto</h2><p data-widget-id="7127fecb-9de5-4a6b-92c4-765c89d5ab06" data-widget-type="text">Tenemos un cupo por trimestre. Escríbenos y te decimos si encajamos.</p><address data-widget-id="44813bd3-2634-45a7-9129-a4e79799de44" data-widget-type="business_info" class="v2-business-info"><strong>Vento Estudio</strong><a href="tel:+52 55 4821 9930">+52 55 4821 9930</a><a href="mailto:hola@vento.studio">hola@vento.studio</a><span>Ciudad de México</span></address></div><div class="v2-column" data-column-id="3d854803-017d-42c7-9c00-1a1a8bf0de1f" style="--span-d:6;--span-t:6;--span-m:12"><div data-widget-id="e2fe8b5b-46bc-4c7c-aadc-d714e4d2fd97" data-widget-type="form" id="contact" class="v2-form-wrap"><form data-cluster-form data-endpoint="/api/leads"><label>Nombre<input name="name" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name"></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" maxlength="160" autocomplete="email"></label><label>Teléfono<input name="phone" type="tel" maxlength="40" autocomplete="tel"></label><label class="v2-wide">Mensaje<textarea name="message" required